{"id": "34557", "title": "追逐爱情的脚步", "author": "岑扬", "category": "文学名著", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34557.htm", "intro": "该死的！怎么这么麻烦，老是忘不掉那家伙！站在街上咬三明治时想他，躺在公园草地上时想他，甚至连到商店买头痛药时也想他！就算他是第一个能吻到她的男孩，可她就爱这种没有拘束，东飘西荡的生活，她没办法为了一个人放弃自由飞翔的羽翼！偏偏他仿佛变成她的一部份，想割舍也除不了……不过——错过就是错过，人生总有些时候必须面临取舍，所以在爱情与自由之间，她选择了——啊！那是什么？她眼花吗？身为公司大总裁的他竟赛跑似的狂追她，完全不顾有一群抓麦克风，扛摄影机的记者正跟在他后头……哦！这就是他爱她的方式——她跑他就追！嗯……她喜欢！", "base": "files/article/html/34/34557", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2191471.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2191472.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2191473.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2191474.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2191475.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2191476.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2191477.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2191478.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2191479.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2191480.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2191481.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2191482.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2191483.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2191484.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2191486.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2191487.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2191488.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2191489.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2191490.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2191491.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2191492.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2191493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2191494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2191495.html", "available": false}, 